<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\ヘリ荒田.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\ヘリ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The deafening clatter of a helicopter―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wake up to that sound.<PG>
Maybe that isn't quite the right way to put it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Better to say I come back to my senses.<PG>
I had been awake the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ever since then, I had forgotten to eat, to sleep, and even to breathe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A helicopter flying about in the morning sun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What has it come for?<PG>
Of course. After a forest fire like this, there must be a huge uproar.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then they'll find me sooner or later.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then... 
{PAUSE ""}
what I did will be found out sooner or later.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオク遠く.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Without a wink of sleep, I had lain spread-eagled in the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beside me lies the gun, every round fired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I... how many people did I kill?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably 30, at least.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">“Our next story. Late last night, a forest fire broke out in the Arata district, which borders the north of Iizawa Prefecture.”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\雲わすれの夏.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオク.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What was that feeling back then?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remember going out of my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But right before that―
{PAUSE ""}
after <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE> was cut down, right before I went out of my mind―
{PAUSE ""}
a feeling I had never known raced through me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔背景.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔ぼかし.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔背景ぼかし.lcm" "REPEAT" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
An urge to kill I couldn't hold back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A desire to kill I could not suppress, whatever I did.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fierce murderous intent toward <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-san</STYLE> welled up in me.<PG>
{DELETECG "222,000,111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">“Several burned bodies have been found, and there is said to be no hope that the residents survived.”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオク.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
How did it come to that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pressed the muzzle to the heads of <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> and pulled the trigger without the slightest hesitation.<PG>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">“Most of the bodies are badly damaged, and identifying them is expected to take time.”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔背景.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔ぼかし.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then the urge to kill ebbed smoothly away, and I felt intense pleasure and satisfaction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did it―I was able to kill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had eliminated what threatened me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I killed <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-san</STYLE>, and it felt so good.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "222" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔背景ぼかし.lcm" "REPEAT" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\記憶横顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Could that have been a curse-killing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'm not green-eyed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it can't be a curse-killing...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I take my phone out of my pocket and look at my face on it, and―<PG>
{CHANGECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "222" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">“However, many of the residents are believed to have been shot dead by someone</STYLE>―<STYLE ID="1">”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオク銃.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My eyes... one is dark brown, but―
{PAUSE ""}
the other one is―
{PAUSE ""}
green.<PG>
Haha. So that's what it was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no such thing as curses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But curse-killing really does exist.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I proved it myself.<PG>
When you're doused in <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san's</STYLE> blood―
{PAUSE ""}
doused in the second generation's blood―
{PAUSE ""}
you're driven by an unbearable desire to kill the others doused in the same blood.<PG>
{CHANGECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "1" "1" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">“It is believed to be the work of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">suspect Momoko Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, 24, who was in the Arata district at the time.”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオク.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After I shot the two of them dead, every one of my cells let out a <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ほうこう">roar</STYLE> of joy, and I was drunk on the pleasure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, a feeling opposed to it was born.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was intense grief and anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted some way to get rid of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instinctive pleasure, and rational anger and grief―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those two took control of my mind, and...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I shot dead every person I saw.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I killed them all.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their legs were cut and they couldn't move, and I rained bullets on them without mercy.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My desire for revenge, which should have perished, changed its form―
{PAUSE ""}
became the <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="にくしみ">tumor</STYLE> itself, and <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="よみがえ">came back to life</STYLE>.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="うらみ">tumor</STYLE> that should have been cured recurred.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="いかり">tumor</STYLE> that should have gone into remission recurred.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I must have been out of my mind.
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
So it wasn't me who killed <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's this Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not to blame.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not to blame.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">I'm not to blame...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">I'm not to blame!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hey, someone... 
{PAUSE ""}
take my side!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm... not to blame, right...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Suspect Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was holding a handgun and was found lying in a clearing outside the area the fire had spread to.”</STYLE><PG>
I wanted revenge on a settlement like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Toward the Arata settlement that killed <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, a desire for revenge I couldn't hold back showed itself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I was the one who killed <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
I took revenge on the Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\真呪殺編\キオク\キオクアップ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After killing everyone there, I headed for the blazing settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was still one left. The person I really wanted to kill.<PG>
Inside the settlement was a middle-aged woman.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "火の粉.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\美冬火事.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I had seen this woman's face in a photo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Found her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Found her at last.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">That</STYLE> was the one who killed <STYLE ID="14">Erina</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="13">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> was staring up at the flames.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could she be thinking?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like <STYLE ID="15">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, does she think it's all over?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>, does she think it'll be fine if they rebuild?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="13">she</STYLE> has no need to worry about that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have no hesitation left in me now.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\銃声.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n200\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\赤背景.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I shot <STYLE ID="13">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> dead before she noticed me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, I had killed every person in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My revenge had been achieved.
